Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: GSExplorer+
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/gstvslzr/GSExplorer/issues
Source: https://github.com/gstvslzr/GSExplorer
Comment: GSExplorer+ bundles a private Python runtime and Qt for Python under
 /opt/gsexplorer-plus so it does not depend on the system Python. The full
 license texts of every bundled component, generated at build time, are in
 /opt/gsexplorer-plus/share/licenses/ (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt there).
 Corresponding source for the bundled LGPL libraries is attached to each
 release at https://github.com/gstvslzr/GSExplorer/releases

